      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Introducing <strong>Not APC556!</strong> — a collection of rifles imported from the fictional firearms manufacturer <strong>Expedite Firearms</strong> in Call of Duty. These rifles are the bigger siblings to the ISO SMG line, offering a mix of power and customization options.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8959-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8959-pasted-from-clipboard-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8960-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8960-pasted-from-clipboard-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8961-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8961-pasted-from-clipboard-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>Included Versions:</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong>.300 BLK</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong>5.56x45mm NATO</strong></p>\n<p>- <strong>.308 Winchester</strong></p>\n<p>Each version offers unique performance characteristics, with various barrel, handguard, and stock modifications available.</p>\n<p>Note: Due to ammo-based damage mechanics, the <strong>5.56 version</strong> with its 600 RPM will have a DPS comparable to the <strong>AK-102</strong>.</p>\n<p>Models and textures are properties of <strong>Activision</strong>.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Setup and Usage</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Drop the mod files into the spt folder of your game.</p>\n<p>2. Customize rifle options with the available barrel, handguard, and stock modifications.</p>\n<p>3. Each variant is modular and can be selectively disabled or customized to your preference.</p>\n<p>4. For best compatibility and performance, refer to your mod loader’s documentation.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Permissions and Legal</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>When reuploading or sharing this mod</strong>, please clearly indicate the author or source.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Do not distribute files with the <code>.bundle</code> extension</strong> (or its variants) from this mod without permission.</p>\n<p>- Respect the original creator’s rights as these models and textures are properties of <strong>Activision</strong>.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>Original models and textures:</strong> Activision</p>\n<p>- <strong>Special thanks to:</strong> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/18902-massivesoft/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
